1. shotcuts

Alt+I       .local/bin/site
Alt+M       .local/bin/pm
Alt+N       .local/bin/bjwd
Alt+E       .local/bin/clipbd
Alt+P       .local/bin/pdf
Alt+C       .local/bin/config

Shift+Enter # open a window for input method in Minecraft Game

Mod+T   # open a floating window for sdcv
Mod+Shift+Enter  # open a normal floating window

2. Screenshot

Ctrl+Alt+Shift+P # select a area for screenshot
Ctrl+Alt+Shift+S # pick a whole winow
Ctrl+Alt+S       # pick the forus column 

3. Audio

Ctrl+Alt+0      # increase volume
Ctrl+Alt+9      # decrease volume
Ctrl+Alt+8      # mute

4. Brightness

Ctrl+Alt+Shift+0    # increase brightness
Ctrl+Alt+Shift+9    # decrease brightness

5. window

Mod+<1..0>  # move at workspace which spcify by a number
Mod+Q/H   # focus forward window
Mod+E/L   # focus backward window
Mod+O       # workspace overview
Mod+Shift+Q     # quit focus window
Mod+Shift+H/J/K/L   # move focus window to a position what u want

